      "association_text": "Prevotella copri is enriched in the gut microbiome of healthy controls compared to patients with non-small-cell lung cancer (NSCLC), as identified by LEfSe analysis of 16S rRNA stool sequencing from 96 NSCLC patients versus 139 healthy controls.",
